  "ruleText": "Puc 1801.06 “REScheck” means the computer software program and paper forms designed to allow an applicant to calculate and demonstrate compliance of a structure with the energy code.\n\nSource. #6879, eff 2-1-99, EXPIRED: 2-1-07\n\nNew. #8811, INTERIM, eff 2-2-07, EXPIRED: 8-1-07\n\nNew. #8958, eff 7-31-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-15\n\nNew. #10908, eff 8-8-15",
